editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/state/movement-003/AUTHOR-REPORT.md:170:- Hesk's letter, behind the observation notebook's front board.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/state/movement-003/AUTHOR-REPORT.md:171:- Bracken's pouch, running both ways. Gault's scarf as Cael's sling.
